    "summary": "Supervisor.track and allowRestart (replace() now uses allowRestart); SessionPool hands each created worker to onCreated (via the start dep's onCreated) and asks restarted before the shared-state worker's restart after an exit; startSessionRouting wires both to the supervisor; the document-summary worker is published (role document-summary) on start and forgotten on exit. Also fixes an s3 gap the tracking exposed: maintenance now asks the session pool's workers to close their graph handles before compacting (they were never asked; the threads-boot maintenance test failed once they were counted and passes with the fix).",
